    title: "Supply Teacher Pay UK",
    metaTitle: "Supply Teacher Pay UK 2026/27: Daily Rates Explained",
    metaDescription:
      "How supply teachers are paid in 2026/27: the 1/195th daily rate rule, agency vs direct engagement, when holiday pay kicks in, and realistic annual earnings.",
    primaryKeyword: "supply teacher pay",
