    title: "Teaching Assistant Salary UK",
    metaTitle: "Teaching Assistant Salary UK 2026/27: Real Pay Guide",
    metaDescription:
      "What teaching assistants earn in 2026/27: hourly rates, term-time-only maths, how grades work, HLTA progression and why advertised figures mislead so many people.",
    primaryKeyword: "teacher assistant salary uk",
