    title: "College Teacher Salary UK",
    metaTitle: "College Teacher Salary UK 2026/27: FE Lecturer Pay",
    metaDescription:
      "What further education lecturers earn in 2026/27: realistic college salary ranges, why no national scale exists, TPS access and how sixth-form colleges differ.",
    primaryKeyword: "college teacher salary uk",
